[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13202.55, "timestamp": "03:40:02", "text": "静かに背景に溶け込む。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13204.71, "timestamp": "03:40:04", "text": "食べる。ここから抜け出す。あなたはしない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13206.99, "timestamp": "03:40:06", "text": "魔女でなければならない。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13209.91, "timestamp": "03:40:09", "text": "ここは深海の住処である。何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13212.55, "timestamp": "03:40:12", "text": "Cはもう一度同じことをするのですか？そして私は楽しみにしています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13214.63, "timestamp": "03:40:14", "text": "全員を狩り出す。戦いは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13220.79, "timestamp": "03:40:20", "text": "五。 4 3 2 1。あなたがすべきことは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13223.71, "timestamp": "03:40:23", "text": "任務区域を制圧すること。手に入れた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13226.71, "timestamp": "03:40:26", "text": "それ。外は暗いジャングルだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13228.309, "timestamp": "03:40:28", "text": "宇宙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13242.67, "timestamp": "03:40:42", "text": "に"}]